msgstr "Qiskit SDK v2.1 o posterior, con soporte de [visualización](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/visualization)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Runtime v0.40 or later (`pip install qiskit-ibm-runtime`)\n"
msgstr "Qiskit Runtime v0.40 o posterior (`pip install qiskit-ibm-runtime`)\n"

